## What it is

A battle royale shooter centered on scavenging equipment, positioning, and surviving a shrinking play area.

## Before you install

Checked 23 November 2026. Steam lists PUBG Corporation as developer and KRAFTON, Inc. as publisher, with a release date of 21 December 2017. The listing covers online PvP only, with partial controller support. The minimum column asks for 64-bit Windows 10, an Intel Core i5-4430 or AMD FX-6300, 8 GB of memory, an NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 2GB or AMD Radeon R7 370 2GB, DirectX 11, a broadband connection, and 40 GB of storage.

PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS is a battle royale. Steam’s app details, checked 8 November 2026, list Windows for the free base game. Compare your PC with the system requirements on that page, and treat any paid extras as separate from the free game.

## Official installation and support

Follow the official store link above for installation and updates. GameNews does not host game files. If installation fails, record the error and your hardware details before consulting the publisher's support resources.

